[13.971775, "o", "lex-trail  ·  Content-addressed audit chains for AI agents  Every decision. SHA-256 content-addressed. Deterministically replayable. Tamper-evident.  \r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n  Session 1 — ORD-001  qty=100  ACCEPTED   (5 events)  \r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n  a2a.task.received     id: a7375152d97e5146...  parent: root\r\n  spec.allowed          id: 2cd176b14fed4e04...  parent: a7375152...\r\n  cap.invoked           id: a74720cc2cfce62d...  parent: 2cd176b1...\r\n  llm.step              id: 32e5e650a66054c1...  parent: a74720cc...\r\n  cap.completed         id: 7c71d2229c4725b7...  parent: 32e5e650...  \r\n─────────"]
[13.971817, "o", "───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n  Session 2 — ORD-BAD  qty=5000  REJECTED  (3 events)  \r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n  a2a.task.received     id: 4b3598c64f3bbaee...  parent: root\r\n  spec.denied           id: c8468020fa69f6a5...  parent: 4b3598c6...\r\n  cap.failed            id: 5cc5bb417eb3f294...  parent: c8468020...  \r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n  Chain Verification — SHA-256 sequential hash chain  \r\n───────────────────────"]
[13.97192, "o", "─────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n\r\n  Session 1: verify_chain → ✓  5 events, chain intact\r\n\r\n  Session 2: verify_chain → ✓  3 events, chain intact  \r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n  Replay — walk_chain from Session 1 leaf back to root  \r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n  Starting from leaf: 7c71d2229c47...\r\n  walk_chain follows parent pointers back to root — causal order:\r\n  [1] cap.completed         id: 7c71d2229c47...\r\n  [2] llm.step              id: 32e5e650a660...\r\n  [3] cap.invoked           id: a74720cc2cfc..."]
[13.971982, "o", "\r\n  [4] spec.allowed          id: 2cd176b14fed...\r\n  [5] a2a.task.received     id: a7375152d97e...  \r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n  Audit Report — export.task_report for Session 2 (ORD-BAD rejected)  \r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n  Full audit report for the rejected session — every decision, cryptographically chained.{\"task_id\":\"TASK-002\",\"event_count\":3,\"all_valid\":true,\"events\":[{\"id\":\"4b3598c64f3bbaeeaed68777a027b8fdff5d8bf5a5bc15364231beffae3f92e7\",\"kind\":\"a2a.task.received\",\"parent\":null,\"payload\":{\"task_id\":\"TASK-002\",\"from_agent\":\"trading-agent\",\"skill\":\"submit_order\",\"params\":{\"symbol\":\"MSFT\",\"qty\":5000}},\"ts_ms\":178030348"]
[13.972022, "o", "8166,\"valid\":true},{\"id\":\"c8468020fa69f6a541b7bef10d77b11bef5da961efb8bb74dfffc7b7de87f835\",\"kind\":\"spec.denied\",\"parent\":\"4b3598c64f3bbaeeaed68777a027b8fdff5d8bf5a5bc15364231beffae3f92e7\",\"payload\":{\"task_id\":\"TASK-002\",\"spec\":\"order_submit_policy\",\"bindings\":{\"tool\":\"submit_order\",\"qty\":5000,\"approved\":true},\"reason\":\"quantity 5000 exceeds limit 1000\"},\"ts_ms\":1780303488166,\"valid\":true},{\"id\":\"5cc5bb417eb3f2940fb6e234bb04ac11255d1833dd41d5894c887c5a1a1e90c7\",\"kind\":\"cap.failed\",\"parent\":\"c8468020fa69f6a541b7bef10d77b11bef5da961efb8bb74dfffc7b7de87f835\",\"payload\":{\"task_id\":\"TASK-002\",\"capability\":\"validate_order\",\"error\":\"spec denied: quantity 5000 exceeds limit 1000\"},\"ts_ms\":1780303488166,\"valid\":true}]}  \r\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n  Tamper Detection — why content-addressing matters  \r\n─────────"]
[13.972047, "o", "───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n  Same content → same SHA-256 id  (idempotent append: INSERT OR IGNORE).\r\n  Mutate any byte in payload_json → id no longer matches stored hash.\r\n  verify_chain catches it: chain_hash is SHA-256(prev_hash:event_id:seq).\r\n  Delete any row → seq gap detected immediately.\r\n  No trust in the agent's code — trust in the math.\r\n"]
[13.975295, "o", "\r\n"]
[15.481494, "o", "\u001b[2m"]
[15.481566, "o", "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[32mDONE\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[15.481597, "o", "  Session 1: ORD-001 — 5-event chain, qty=100 accepted, SHA-256 ids linked by parent.\r\n"]
[15.481753, "o", "  Session 2: ORD-BAD — 3-event chain, qty=5000 denied by spec, cap.failed recorded.\r\n  verify_chain: walks seq+hash pairs — Ok(5) and Ok(3), both intact.\r\n  walk_chain:   follows parent pointers from leaf to root — full causal replay.\r\n  task_report:  JSON audit export, all_valid=true, every payload visible.\r\n  Tamper detect: mutate a byte → SHA-256 mismatch; delete a row → seq gap.\r\n\r\n\u001b[2m"]
[15.481813, "o", "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
